and dynamic estimates of network robustness.} Boxplot showing aggregated
realised topological and dynamic robustness for the different network
types. Each extinction scenario is presented in the supp matt but note
that the with the exception of the random basal extinctions this pattern
remains consistent}

\end{figure}
